001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.    SQUOTDEL.
001300 AUTHOR.        BARBARA WINTER.
001400*DATE-WRITTEN.  SEPTEMBER 1987.
001500*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
001600*
001700*REMARKS.
001800*************************************************************
001900*                   S Q U O T D E L                         *
002000*   --  DELETES QUOTES BASED ON QUOTE NUMBER OR EXPIRATION  *
002100*                                                           *
002200*  QUOTE NUMBER OR EXPIRATION DATE MAY BE ENTERED.  IF THE  *
002300*  USER REQUESTS TO VIEW QUOTE BEFORE DELETING, THE QUOTES  *
002400*  WILL DISPLAY AND THE USER CAN PRESS F2 TO SAVE OR F3 TO  *
002500*  DELETE AND CONTINUE ON TO THE NEXT QUOTE.  IF THE USER   *
002600*  DOES NOT WANT TO VIEW THE QUOTES, THE QUOTES WILL BE     *
002700*  DELETED VIA A JOBSTREAM SO THAT THE TERMINAL WILL BE     *
002800*  FREED IMMEDIATELY.
002900*************************************************************
      *C  09/13/96  WL  MCINTYRE
      *C    MADE REVISIONS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPATABILITY
      *C
      *C  09/16/96  WL  MCINTYRE
      *C    CORRECT ORIGINAL LOGIC SO THAT PROGRAM CAN NOW
      *C    CORRECTLY DO ONLINE QUOTE DELETES BY DATE ENTERED
      *C
003000 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
003100 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
003200 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
003300 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
003300 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
003200 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZUDCQUOT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
            SELECT DVENDITM3-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0803
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DVENDITM3-O
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0803
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DQUOTEXT-O
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3801
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DVENDOR-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
003500 DATA DIVISION.
003800 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC          PIC X(2000).
       FD  DVENDITM3-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDITM3-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0800  OF MCFLCS0803.
       FD  DVENDITM3-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDITM3-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0800  OF MCFLCS0803.
       FD  DQUOTEXT-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DQUOTEXT-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3800  OF MCFLCS3801.
       FD  DVENDOR-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDOR-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0700  OF MCFLCS0701.
