010900 01  SCREEN-BUFFER.
011000     05  VIEW-QUOTE           PIC X(6)     VALUE SPACES.
011100     05  VIEW-OLDDATE         PIC X(6)     VALUE SPACES.
011200     05  VIEW-DISPLAY         PIC X        VALUE SPACE.
011300     05  VIEW-DQUOTE          PIC X(6)     VALUE SPACES.
