012700         88  END-OF-FILE                          VALUE 11.
012800         88  START-OF-CHAIN                       VALUE 14.
012900         88  END-OF-CHAIN                         VALUE 15.
013000         88  NO-ENTRY                             VALUE 17.
013100     05  DATA-LENGTH          PIC S9(4)  COMP-4.
013200     05  RCD-NO               PIC S9(9)  COMP-4.
013300     05  CHAIN-LENGTH         PIC S9(9)  COMP-4.
013400     05  BKWD-ADDR            PIC S9(9)  COMP-4.
013500     05  FWRD-ADDR            PIC S9(9)  COMP-4.
013600
