014200
016300 COPY DVENDITM  OF COPYLIB.
016400 COPY DVENDOR   OF COPYLIB.
016500 COPY DQUOTEXT  OF COPYLIB.
016700 LINKAGE SECTION.
016800 01  BASE                     PIC X(10).
016900 01  PASS-SPOOL               PIC S9(2) COMP-4.
017000 COPY VCOMLINK OF COPYLIB.
017100 01  FORMFILE                   PIC X(26).
017200 COPY LANGSUB  OF COPYLIB.
017300
017400*******************************************************************
017500*                     PROCEDURE DIVISION
017600*******************************************************************
017700 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING   BASE,
017800                            PASS-SPOOL,
017900                            VIEW-COMAREA,
018000                            FORMFILE,
018100                            LANGUAGE-PARMS.
018200
018300 00-MAIN.
           OPEN INPUT DVENDITM3-I DVENDOR-I.
           OPEN I-O   DVENDITM3-O DQUOTEXT-O DISPLAY-FILE.
018400     MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE.
018500     CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
018600     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO TODAY-DATE.
018700
018800     MOVE 04               TO LANG-SETNUM.
018900     MOVE 09               TO LANG-MSGNUM.
019000     PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
019100     MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER   TO DELETE-QUOTE-MSG.
019200
019300     MOVE 17               TO LANG-MSGNUM.
019400     PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
019500     MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER   TO DELETE-DESC-MSG.
019600
019700     MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
019800     PERFORM 100-GET-ENTRY   THRU 199-EXIT.
019900
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.
           CLOSE DVENDITM3-I DVENDITM3-O DVENDOR-I DQUOTEXT-O.
020000 09-EXIT.
           GOBACK.
020100
020200*************************************************************
020300*       READ AND VALIDATE INPUT                             *
020400*************************************************************
020500 100-GET-ENTRY.
021100     MOVE SPACES                        TO SCREEN-BUFFER.
           MOVE "000000" TO VIEW-QUOTE.
           MOVE ZEROES   TO VIEW-DITEM.
           MOVE "Y"      TO VIEW-DISPLAY.
021110 120-SHOW-FORM.
021200     MOVE MAIN-SCREEN TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO SCREEN-BUFFER.
           MOVE 0 TO FIELD-NUMBER.

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
035800
035900     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 3
036000        GO TO 199-EXIT.
036100
036200     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 2 OR
036300        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 4 OR
036400        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 5 OR
036500        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 6 OR
036600        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 7 OR
036700        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8
036800        PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
036900        GO TO 120-SHOW-FORM.
023800
023900*----------  F1=HELP SCREEN
024000     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1
              MOVE "ZUDCQUOT"            TO  VIEW-CFNAME
024170        MOVE "HQTDEL" TO HELP-FORMNAME
024180        CALL "SHELPSCR" USING VIEW-COMAREA LANGUAGE-PARMS
024190                              HELP-FORMNAME
024200        GO TO 120-SHOW-FORM.

      *-----  MAKE SURE THAT AT LEAST ON ENTRY WAS SELECTED

           IF VIEW-QUOTE = "000000" AND VIEW-OLDDATE = SPACES
      *******   YOU MUST SELECT ONE OF THE SELECTION CRITERIA
                   MOVE  66  TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 157  TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   MOVE B"1" TO IND (4)
                   MOVE 1 TO FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
                   GO TO 120-SHOW-FORM.

      *-----  CAN ONLY SELECT ONE ENTRY

           IF VIEW-QUOTE NOT = "000000"
              IF VIEW-OLDDATE NOT = SPACES
      *******   SELECT ONLY ONE OPTION
                   MOVE  66  TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 140  TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   MOVE B"1" TO IND (4)
                   MOVE 1 TO FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
                   GO TO 120-SHOW-FORM.

025300*----------  VALIDATE IF QUOTE EXISTS
025400     IF VIEW-QUOTE  = "000000"
              GO TO 125-VALIDATE-DATE.
025500     MOVE VIEW-QUOTE       TO QUOTE-ARG-NUM.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE QUOTE-ARG TO QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM3-REC-O.
           START DVENDITM3-O KEY = QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM3-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
025800        IF NO-ENTRY
025900******* QUOTE DOES NOT EXIST
026000             MOVE 17 TO LANG-SETNUM
026100             MOVE 08 TO LANG-MSGNUM
026200             PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
026300             PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
026400             GO TO 120-SHOW-FORM
026500        ELSE
026600         IF NOT GOOD-CALL
026700        MOVE "DBFIND DVENDITM 120 SQUOTDEL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
026800        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

           GO TO 130-STREAM-OR-DO-DELETE.
026900
027000 125-VALIDATE-DATE.
027100     IF VIEW-OLDDATE NOT = SPACES
027200        MOVE VIEW-OLDDATE TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
027300        MOVE 3 TO DATE-MODE
027400        CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA LANGUAGE-PARMS
027500        IF DATE-RET-CODE NOT = 0
027600           MOVE DATE-MSG TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
027700           MOVE 4 TO FIELD-NUMBER
027800           PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
027900           GO TO 120-SHOW-FORM
028000        ELSE
028100           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO COMPARE-DATE.

      *-----  ADD CENTURY TO DATE

           IF COMPARE-DATE NUMERIC
              IF COMPARE-YEAR > "70"
                 MOVE "19" TO COMPARE-CENT
              ELSE
                 MOVE "20" TO COMPARE-CENT.

       130-STREAM-OR-DO-DELETE.
029000
029100     IF VIEW-DISPLAY = "N"
029200        PERFORM 300-STREAM-DELETE-JOB THRU 399-EXIT
029300     ELSE
029400        IF VIEW-QUOTE = "000000"
                 PERFORM 810-READ-FIRST-REC THRU 819-EXIT
029500           PERFORM 200-DISPLAY-QUOTES THRU 299-EXIT
029600        ELSE
029700           PERFORM 400-DELETE-ONE-QUOTE THRU 499-EXIT.
029800
029900     GO TO 100-GET-ENTRY.
030000 199-EXIT.  EXIT.
030100 200-DISPLAY-QUOTES.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DVENDITM3-I NEXT INTO BUF-DVENDITM
             AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
030400     IF END-OF-CHAIN
030500        GO TO 299-EXIT.
030600     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
030700        MOVE "DBGET AQUOTENUM 200 SQUOTDEL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
030800        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
030900
           IF QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM3-REC-I = COMPARE-QUOTE
              GO TO 200-DISPLAY-QUOTES.
           MOVE QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM3-REC-I TO COMPARE-QUOTE,
                                 QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM3-REC-O,
                                               QUOTE-ARG.
031100     START DVENDITM3-O KEY = QUOTE-ARG
                 INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
031200     PERFORM 700-DELETE-ITEMS THRU 799-EXIT.
031300     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
031400        GO TO 299-EXIT.
           GO TO 200-DISPLAY-QUOTES.
031600 299-EXIT.  EXIT.
031700
031800 300-STREAM-DELETE-JOB.
031900*    MOVE  14                             TO LANG-SETNUM
032000*    MOVE   2                             TO LANG-MSGNUM
032100*    PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
032200*    PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT.
032900
033000*----------  PREPARE JOB STREAM THAT WILL UPDATE QUOTE DEFAULTS
033100     MOVE "BQTDELJB"                      TO STRM-JOB-NAME.
033300     MOVE "TQTDELJB"                      TO STRM-RUN-CARD.
033400     IF VIEW-QUOTE = "000000"
033500        MOVE CY-COMPARE-DATE              TO PASS-STRM1
033600        MOVE "D"                          TO PASS-STRM2
033700     ELSE
033800        MOVE VIEW-QUOTE                   TO PASS-STRM1
033900        MOVE "Q"                          TO PASS-STRM2.
034000     MOVE PASS-TO-STRMJOB                 TO STRM-OPTION-CARD1.
034200     CALL "TSTRMJOB" USING STRMRPT-COMAREA.
      *    CALL "TQTDELJB" USING STRM-OPTION-CARD1.
034300
035400 399-EXIT.  EXIT.
035500
035600 400-DELETE-ONE-QUOTE.
035700     PERFORM 700-DELETE-ITEMS THRU 799-EXIT.
035800 499-EXIT.  EXIT.
035900
036000 700-DELETE-ITEMS.
037000     MOVE QUOTE-ARG-NUM TO MSG-QUOTE, VIEW-DQUOTE.
037100     MOVE 1 TO MSG-CURRENT-NO, DISPLAY-CTR.
037200     MOVE 0 TO SAVE-CTR.
037300     MOVE TODAY-DATE TO VIEW-TODAY.
037400
037500 705-DISPLAY-FIRST-ITEM.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DVENDITM3-O NEXT INTO BUF-DVENDITM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM3-REC-O NOT = QUOTE-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF END-OF-CHAIN
              GO TO 799-EXIT.
038800     IF VEN-QUOTE-FLAG NOT = "Q"
038900        GO TO 705-DISPLAY-FIRST-ITEM.
039000
038000     IF VIEW-QUOTE = "000000"
038100     IF VEN-ITM-PRICE-DATE = SPACES
038200        GO TO 705-DISPLAY-FIRST-ITEM.
038300
038400     IF VIEW-QUOTE = "000000"
038500     IF VEN-ITM-PRICE-DATE-CN > CY-COMPARE-DATE
038600        GO TO 705-DISPLAY-FIRST-ITEM.
038700
039100     MOVE VEN-ITM-VENCODE TO VENDOR-ARG, VIEW-VENDORC.
039200
039300*----------  FIND VENDOR NAME
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE VENDOR-ARG TO VENCDE OF DVENDOR-REC-I.
           START DVENDOR-I KEY = VENCDE OF DVENDOR-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
039600     IF NO-ENTRY
039700        MOVE "NO VENDOR NAME AVAILABLE" TO VIEW-VENDORN
039800        GO TO 720-QUOTE-INFO.
039900     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
040000        MOVE "DBFIND DVENDOR 705 SQUOTDEL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
040100        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
040200
040300 710-DVENDOR-LOOP.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DVENDOR-I NEXT INTO BUF-DVENDOR
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF VENCDE OF DVENDOR-REC-I NOT = VENDOR-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
040600     IF END-OF-CHAIN
040700       MOVE "NO VENDOR NAME AVAILABLE" TO VIEW-VENDORN
040800        GO TO 720-QUOTE-INFO.
040900     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
041000        MOVE "DBGET DVENDOR 710 SQUOTDEL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
041100        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
041200
041300     IF VEN-ITM-NO = "00"
041400        MOVE VEN-ITM-DATA    TO VIEW-VENDORN
041500     ELSE
041600        GO TO 710-DVENDOR-LOOP.
041700
041800 720-QUOTE-INFO.
041900     MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE.
042000
042100     MOVE VEN-ITM-PRICE-DATE TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN.
042200     CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA LANGUAGE-PARMS.
042300     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO VIEW-EXPDATE.
042400
042500     IF VEN-CREATE-DATE = SPACES
042600        MOVE SPACES TO VIEW-CREATEDT
042700     ELSE
042800        MOVE VEN-CREATE-DATE TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
042900        CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA LANGUAGE-PARMS
043000        MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO VIEW-CREATEDT.
043100
043200     MOVE VEN-BUYER-CODE TO VIEW-DBUYERC.
043300
043310 725-GET-FORM.
043400     MOVE DELETE-SCREEN TO VIEW-NFNAME.
044800
044900 730-DISPLAY-ITEM.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO SCREEN-BUFFER.

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
035800
035900     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 2 OR 3
036000        GO TO 799-EXIT.
036100
036200     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 4 OR
036300        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 5 OR
036400        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 6 OR
036500        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 7
036800        PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
036900        GO TO 730-DISPLAY-ITEM.
023800
045700
045800*----------  F1=HELP SCREEN
045900     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1
046000        MOVE "HQTDEL" TO HELP-FORMNAME
046100        CALL "SHELPSCR" USING VIEW-COMAREA LANGUAGE-PARMS
046200                              HELP-FORMNAME
046300        GO TO 725-GET-FORM.
046700
046800     MOVE DELETE-QUOTE-MSG TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
046900     PERFORM 800-DISPLAY-DELETE-MSG THRU 809-EXIT.
047000
047100 750-DELETE-QUOTE.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           DELETE DVENDITM3-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
              MOVE "DELETE DVENDITM3-O 750 SQUOTDEL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
048800
048900 760-GET-NEXT-ITEM.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DVENDITM3-O NEXT INTO BUF-DVENDITM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM3-REC-O NOT = QUOTE-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
049200     IF END-OF-CHAIN
              PERFORM 830-UNLOCK-DVENDITM THRU 839-EXIT
049300        GO TO 770-DELETE-PARAGRAPH.
049400     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
049500        MOVE "DBGET DVENDITM 760 SQUOTDEL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
049600        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
049700
049800     IF VEN-QUOTE-FLAG NOT = "Q"
049900        GO TO 760-GET-NEXT-ITEM.
050000
050100     ADD 1 TO DISPLAY-CTR.
050200     MOVE DELETE-QUOTE-MSG TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
050300     IF DISPLAY-CTR = 10
050400        ADD 10 TO SAVE-CTR
050500        MOVE SAVE-CTR TO MSG-CURRENT-NO
050600        MOVE 1 TO DISPLAY-CTR
050700        PERFORM 800-DISPLAY-DELETE-MSG THRU 809-EXIT.
050800
050900     GO TO 750-DELETE-QUOTE.
051000
051100 770-DELETE-PARAGRAPH.
051200     MOVE 0 TO SAVE-CTR.
051300     MOVE 1 TO DISPLAY-CTR, MSG-CURDESC-NO.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE QUOTE-ARG TO QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-REC-O.
           START DQUOTEXT-O KEY = QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
051600       IF NOT GOOD-CALL
051700          GO TO 799-EXIT.
052100
052200     MOVE CHAIN-LENGTH TO MSG-TOTDESC-NO.
052300     MOVE DELETE-DESC-MSG TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
052400     PERFORM 800-DISPLAY-DELETE-MSG THRU 809-EXIT.
052500 775-GET-TEXT.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DQUOTEXT-O  NEXT INTO BUF-DQUOTEXT
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-REC-O NOT = QUOTE-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
052800     IF END-OF-CHAIN
              PERFORM 820-UNLOCK-DQUOTEXT THRU 829-EXIT
052900        GO TO 799-EXIT.
053000     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
053100        MOVE "DBGET DQUOTEXT AT 775 IN CQTPRT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
053200        MOVE QUOTE-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
053300        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
053400
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           DELETE DQUOTEXT-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
054400
055200     ADD 1 TO DISPLAY-CTR.
055300     IF DISPLAY-CTR = 10
055400        ADD 10 TO SAVE-CTR
055500        MOVE SAVE-CTR TO MSG-CURDESC-NO
055600        MOVE 1 TO DISPLAY-CTR
055700        PERFORM 800-DISPLAY-DELETE-MSG THRU 809-EXIT.
055800
055900     GO TO 775-GET-TEXT.
056000 799-EXIT.  EXIT.
056100
056200 800-DISPLAY-DELETE-MSG.
056300*----------  AVOID BEEP WHEN SHOWING MSG
056400*    ADD 1 TO VIEW-OPTIONS.
056500*    MOVE 76 TO MESSAGE-ACTLEN.
056600*    PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT.
056700*    PERFORM 900-SHOW-FORM THRU 909-EXIT.
056800*----------  TURN BEEP BACK ON
056900*    SUBTRACT 1 FROM VIEW-OPTIONS.
057000 809-EXIT.  EXIT.

       810-READ-FIRST-REC.
           CLOSE DVENDITM3-I.
           OPEN INPUT DVENDITM3-I.
           MOVE SPACES TO QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM3-REC-I
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD
           START DVENDITM3-I KEY > QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM3-REC-I
             INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
              MOVE "START DVENDITM3-I 810 SQUOTDEL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
           MOVE "******" TO COMPARE-QUOTE.
       819-EXIT.  EXIT.

       820-UNLOCK-DQUOTEXT.
      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-REC-O.
           START DQUOTEXT-O KEY > QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.
       829-EXIT.  EXIT.
057100
       830-UNLOCK-DVENDITM.
      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM3-REC-O.
           START DVENDITM3-O KEY > QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM3-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.
       839-EXIT.  EXIT.
128700 940-VSETERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (99).
           IF FIELD-NUMBER > 0
              MOVE B"1" TO IND (FIELD-NUMBER).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE-MESSAGE-LINE.
051300
048600 949-EXIT.  EXIT.
204300 990-BLOWUP.
204400     MOVE VIEW-QUOTE      TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
204500     MOVE QUOTE-ARG       TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
204600     MOVE VIEW-NFNAME     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3).
204900     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
205000                   VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
205100                   BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
205200 999-EXIT.     EXIT.
205300
205400 999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
207000 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
207100     EXIT.
